<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Carlsberg plans 1-for-2 bonus.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Carlsberg plans 1-for-2 bonus.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carlsberg Brewery Malaysia Bhd said it is proposing a one-for-two bonus issue of 51 million shares.</p>
<p>In a statement to the stock exchange late on Thursday, the brewery said the proposed bonus issue will be offered to shareholders at a date to be announced later.</p>
<p>It said the aim of the issue is to expand its issued and paid-up share capital to &quot;more appropriately reflect&quot; the assets employed in the company.</p>
<p>On Thursday, it reported 1996 net profit of 91.69 million ringgit, against 77.04 million ringgit a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
